### Summary
This PR raises the bloom_match filter ceiling from 32 MiB to 64 MiB in the 
proxy, effectively doubling the maximum supported bloom filter body size and 
allowing representation of approximately 50 million members at an appropriate 
false positive rate. It updates configuration defaults, proxy limits, the client
SDK, and the internal plan parser validation and hint messaging accordingly. The
PR includes extensive unit tests validating the upgraded size limits and error 
hint mechanisms. CI results on the PR commit show passing test suites.

